  ($q$alg-370$q$, $q$math$q$, $q$Algebra$q$, $q$Linear functions$q$, 2, null, $q$The function f is linear, with f(2) = 9 and f(6) = 21. What is the value of f(0)?$q$, $q$["3","9","6","12"]$q$::jsonb, 0, $q$Slope = (21 − 9)/(6 − 2) = 3, so f(x) = 3x + b. Using f(2) = 9: 6 + b = 9 → b = 3. Thus f(0) = 3.$q$, null),
