  ($q$alg-523$q$, $q$math$q$, $q$Algebra$q$, $q$Word problems$q$, 2, null, $q$A moving company charges a flat fee of $35 plus $11 per hour. A customer was billed a total of $156. How many hours did the move take?$q$, $q$["14","11","10","12"]$q$::jsonb, 1, $q$Total = fixed fee + rate × quantity: 35 + 11n = 156. So 11n = 121 and n = 11.$q$, null),
