  ($q$alg-647$q$, $q$math$q$, $q$Algebra$q$, $q$Linear functions$q$, 1, null, $q$What is the x-intercept of the graph of y = −5x + 10 in the xy-plane?$q$, $q$["(2, 0)","(10, 0)","(−10, 0)","(−2, 0)"]$q$::jsonb, 0, $q$Set y = 0: −5x = −10, so x = 2. The x-intercept is (2, 0).$q$, null),
