  ($q$alg-659$q$, $q$math$q$, $q$Algebra$q$, $q$Linear inequalities in one variable$q$, 1, null, $q$How many integers x satisfy −2 < x + 6 ≤ 4?$q$, $q$["5","7","6","8"]$q$::jsonb, 2, $q$Subtract 6: −8 < x ≤ −2. The integers are −7 through −2, which is 6 integers.$q$, null),
