  ($q$alg-664$q$, $q$math$q$, $q$Algebra$q$, $q$Linear equations in two variables$q$, 1, null, $q$The graph of −x − 3y = −12 in the xy-plane crosses the y-axis at (0, k). What is the value of k?$q$, $q$["−4","12","4","−12"]$q$::jsonb, 2, $q$At the y-axis, x = 0, so −3y = −12 and y = 4. Thus k = 4.$q$, null),
