  ($q$alg-693$q$, $q$math$q$, $q$Algebra$q$, $q$Linear equations in one variable$q$, 1, null, $q$If 9x + 11 = 83, what is the value of x?$q$, $q$["94/9","72","−16/9","8"]$q$::jsonb, 3, $q$Subtract 11 from both sides to get 9x = 72, then divide by 9: x = 8.$q$, null),
