  ($q$adv-282$q$, $q$math$q$, $q$Advanced Math$q$, $q$Exponential equations$q$, 1, null, $q$If 2<sup>x+1</sup> = 128, what is the value of x?$q$, $q$["6","7","5","64"]$q$::jsonb, 0, $q$128 = 2⁷, so x + 1 = 7 → x = 6.$q$, null),
