  ($q$adv-547$q$, $q$math$q$, $q$Advanced Math$q$, $q$Polynomial functions$q$, 2, null, $q$The polynomial p(x) = x² + 5x + c, where c is a constant, has x − 6 as a factor. What is the value of c?$q$, $q$["36","−66","66","30"]$q$::jsonb, 1, $q$Since x − 6 is a factor, p(6) = 0: 36 + 30 + c = 0, so c = −66.$q$, null),
