  ($q$adv-681$q$, $q$math$q$, $q$Advanced Math$q$, $q$Equivalent expressions$q$, 1, null, $q$Which expression is equivalent to (9x² + 2x − 5) − (−7x² + x + 6)?$q$, $q$["16x² + x + 1","16x² + x − 11","2x² + 3x + 1","16x² + 3x + 1"]$q$::jsonb, 1, $q$Distribute the subtraction to every term of the second polynomial, then combine like terms: x² terms give 16x², x terms give x, and constants give −11.$q$, null),
  ($q$adv-682$q$, $q$math$q$, $q$Advanced Math$q$, $q$Quadratic equations$q$, 1, null, $q$What is the positive solution to the equation 3x² + 2 = 29?$q$, $q$["5","3","9","29/3"]$q$::jsonb, 1, $q$Subtract 2 from both sides: 3x² = 27, so x² = 9. Taking the positive square root gives x = 3.$q$, null),
