  ($q$adv-761$q$, $q$math$q$, $q$Advanced Math$q$, $q$Exponential functions$q$, 2, null, $q$For the exponential function f, f(0) = 2 and f(1) = 8. What is the value of f(2)?$q$, $q$["16","8","32","14"]$q$::jsonb, 2, $q$f(x) = a·b^x with a = f(0) = 2. Since f(1) = 2·b = 8, b = 4. So f(2) = 2·4^2 = 32.$q$, null),
